  "composer": {
    "rawText": "[Song Title: Rooms of Unfinished Light]\n[Style: indie art-pop, warm upright piano, brushed drums, bowed bass, muted electric guitar harmonics, soft analog pads, clean studio recording, grounded male lead]\n[Caption: A quiet song about rebuilding trust in your own timing.]\n[Image: Window reflections at dusk, each pane holding a different memory.]\n[Refresh Title: Sunset Dreams]\n[Theme: sky]\n[Gradients: 6]\n[Rank: 8]\n[Title Rarity: 0.75]\n[Created: March 5, 2026 at 7:39 PM]\n[Seeds: 519, A:58, B:46, C:88, D:28]\n[Perspective: i_reflect]\n[Concept: I stop forcing resolution and let clarity arrive in small, honest passes.]\n[Topic: emotional_growth -> acceptance_after_noise]\n[Genre Bias: indie art-pop]\n[Style Change: none]\n[Modulation: none]\n[Hook Prominence: medium]\n[Deviation: refrain_tag]\n[Visual Mood: calm]\n[Visual Motion: low]\n[Visual Density: sparse]\n[Visual Lyric Presence: auto]\n[Visual Color Bias: warm]\n[Composer Version: v2.8]\n\n[Intro]\n[piano opens with uneven, human rubato before drums enter on soft brushes]\n[guitar harmonics bloom in the upper register with long decay]\n\n[Verse]\n[Visual: scene=hold; motion=low; density=sparse; focus=texture]\n[long-breath melody with small downward steps at line endings]\nI kept a map of every wrong turn  \nFolded thin from overuse  \nHeld it up against the evening  \nLike proof I could not choose  \n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[rising contour that resolves late into a lower held note]\nThen the streetlights came in slowly  \nAnd took the edges off the view  \n\n[Chorus]\n[Visual: scene=lift; motion=medium; density=normal; focus=vocal]\n[hook with gentle leap on first phrase and conversational release]\nIn rooms of unfinished light  \nI learn to name what I can keep  \nNot every ache needs to be right  \nSome truths arrive when I let them sleep  \n\n[Verse]\n[melody repeats with altered cadence and softer final bar]\nI used to chase the perfect timing  \nCount each breath before I spoke  \nNow I leave a little silence  \nFor the words that still have hope  \n\n[Bridge]\n[Visual: scene=contrast; motion=low; density=sparse; focus=vocal]\n[sustained line over sparse harmony with bowed bass swells]\nIf morning finds me half assembled  \nThat will still be more than none  \nI am not the sum of tremors  \nI am also what I've done  \n\n[Final Chorus]\n[Visual: scene=lift; motion=medium; density=normal; focus=vocal]\n[hook restated with wider backing harmonies and softer landing]\nIn rooms of unfinished light  \nI learn to name what I can keep  \nNot every ache needs to be right  \nSome truths arrive when I let them sleep  \n\n[Ending]\n[refrain_tag]\n[drop to solo piano and a final bowed bass note fading to room tone]\n",
